0e62b79b Ray tracing: copies get memory of their own, null and unknown addresses find an empty structure, BLAS vertices Metal can't read in place are repacked
dd7e7a41 Deferred pipeline and parallel stage compiles off by default (MVK_CONFIG_DEFERRED_PIPELINES=1, MVK_CONFIG_PARALLEL_STAGE_COMPILE=1 turn them on)
11388c02 MetalFX frame interpolation: requiresPrevColorTexture set by name, for builds with SDKs before macOS 27
3d2409c1 Host-resolved timestamps: timeline semaphores never go back, no split in a concurrently encoded command buffer
59a9082a Timestamps copied in the command buffer that sampled them read their values
9c534b46 Metal compiles graphics and compute pipelines on compile threads (MVK_CONFIG_DEFERRED_PIPELINES, on unless 0)
806d98ee MetalFX frame interpolation (VK_METALFX_SCALER_TYPE_FRAME_INTERPOLATION_MVK, macOS 27)
fadac862 MetalFX takes motion vectors at the output resolution (VK_METALFX_SCALE_MOTION_DISPLAY_RES_BIT_MVK)
96090927 Save the implicit pipeline cache outside its lock; serialize per_vertex_vertex_value
241c38cc Timestamps sampled at stage boundaries take one sample per pool per batch
1604a598 Generated dispatches with a count buffer run from an indirect command buffer; fix the buffer address index going stale
4a33eed4 Keep ALL_COMMANDS memory barriers between dispatches in the compute encoder
aa268251 MetalSharp: PerVertexKHR fragment inputs on vertex_value where a drawn triangle shows it works
426727de MetalSharp: a MetalFX swapchain follows the layer's size on screen as it presents
fa48c7d6 MetalSharp: MetalFX swapchain upscaling to the layer's size on screen
0233623f MetalSharp: log why a swapchain that asked for MetalFX upscaling is not upscaled
31d06d81 MetalSharp: MetalFX temporal and denoised scales chained to vkCmdPipelineBarrier2, MetalFX spatial upscaling of swapchains at present (mvk_metalfx.h)
26b8f3a9 Workgroup size: with LocalSizeId the size comes from its constants, also when a WorkgroupSize builtin composite exists (the literal sizes are 0 then, and the threadgroup was 1 thread), and a dimension is specialized only when its constant is a specialization constant (a composite of plain constants read as specialization constant 0)
6cbe8687 Geometry pipelines: ignore pMultisampleState when rasterization is disabled, as the other pipeline paths do. Vulkan allows it to be null then, and newMTLGeometryRenderPipelineDescriptor read its rasterizationSamples: DXVK 3.1's D3D11 stream output with no rasterized stream (a passthrough geometry shader with rasterizer discard) crashed in vkCreateGraphicsPipelines
84a59b28 Geometry shader limits: Vulkan's minimums (32 invocations, 64 input and 128 output components, 256 output vertices, 1024 total output components) instead of 0. Geometry shaders run as Metal mesh pipelines, one mesh threadgroup per invocation and one mesh of at most 256 vertices as its output, but every maxGeometry* limit read 0, so any geometry shader pipeline exceeded what the device reported
